h `first_sample_flags` and `sample_flags`, which is not allowed according to ISO/IEC 14496-12:2015 (section 8.8.8.1).\r\n\r\nI will update the code to make it more robust. This should fix your issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/669333851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kim-vde","id":54320150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzIwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54320150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde","html_url":"https://github.com/kim-vde","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/669408358","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7698#issuecomment-669408358","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7698","id":669408358,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2OTQwODM1OA==","user":{"login":"YongtaoS","id":46325015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzI1MDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46325015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS","html_url":"https://github.com/YongtaoS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-08-05T19:00:09Z","updated_at":"2020-08-05T19:33:27Z","body":"Thank you for your quick response.\r\n\r\nYou are right.\r\n\r\nIf I understand the spec correctly, a proper setting would be : if `first_sample_flags` is present, the `sample_flags` of only the first sample should not be present, but the `sample_flags` of other samples can still be present.\r\nAnd the `first_sample_flags_present` and `sample_flags_present` both can still be `true`.\r\nAm I right?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/669408358/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"YongtaoS","id":46325015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzI1MDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46325015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS","html_url":"https://github.com/YongtaoS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/669745362","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7698#issuecomment-669745362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7698","id":669745362,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2OTc0NTM2Mg==","user":{"login":"kim-vde","id":54320150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzIwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54320150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde","html_url":"https://github.com/kim-vde","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-08-06T07:00:51Z","updated_at":"2020-08-06T07:00:51Z","body":"My understanding is that you cannot have both `first_sample_flags` and `sample_flags` (i.e. `first_sample_flags_present` and `sample_flags_present` cannot be both true). If `first_sample_flags` is present, no `sample_flags` should be specified. Otherwise, `sample_flags` must be specified for every sample.\r\n\r\n`first_sample_flags` is there to avoid repetition in case all samples are the same as the `default_sample_flags` except the first one (because it is a key frame).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/669745362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kim-vde","id":54320150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzIwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54320150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde","html_url":"https://github.com/kim-vde","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-vde/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/669894249","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7698#issuecomment-669894249","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7698","id":669894249,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2OTg5NDI0OQ==","user":{"login":"YongtaoS","id":46325015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzI1MDE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46325015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS","html_url":"https://github.com/YongtaoS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongtaoS/followers","following_url":"http